    <element class="Function" hash="AUF_1489483574688_48497">
      <field name="name">Data Curation</field>
      <field name="description">Check data of patients for plausibility, duplicates etc. and correct if necessary.  Indicate curated data as such. Checks are based on rules for data curation and data quality management. Those rules  may contain actions to be taken e.g. by study nurses in order to acquire additional findings from certain patients for data completion.  Annotate semantic information to data items.

The DIC expects the required rules from R&amp;D teams. The DIC is responsible for proper operation of the rules in daily routine.</field>
    </element>
